{"video":"B-jWgm0M-2U","lines":[{"t":[0.3,1.5],"en":"Fine, okay, fine."},{"t":[1.5,4],"en":"But I gotta say, technically, I didn't even do anything wrong."},{"t":[5.6,6.1],"en":"What?"},{"t":[6.7,8.6],"en":"You didn't do anything wrong?"},{"t":[9.1,10.9],"en":"I said I didn't technically."},{"t":[12.1,14.2],"en":"Okay, well, let's put aside the fact"},{"t":[14.2,17.3],"en":"that you accidentally picked up my grandmother's ring"},{"t":[17.3,20.2],"en":"and you accidentally proposed to Rachel."},{"t":[20.2,21.9],"en":"Can I just stop you right there for a second?"},{"t":[22.1,23],"en":"When people do this,"},{"t":[23.8,25.1],"en":"I don't really know what that means."},{"t":[30,32.7],"en":"You sang."},{"t":[33.3,36.9],"en":"And I can even understand that you couldn't tell Rachel."},{"t":[37.5,39.6],"en":"But why couldn't you tell me, huh?"},{"t":[39.7,41.6],"en":"You went all day to and you didn't."},{"t":[41.7,43],"en":"I know, I should have."},{"t":[43.8,44.8],"en":"I'm sorry."},{"t":[51.1,52.8],"en":"Not using it right, Joe."},{"t":[59.3,60.2],"en":"I'm gonna go."},{"t":[60.4,61],"en":"Oh, come on."},{"t":[61.1,62.9],"en":"Look, Ross, we have to get past this."},{"t":[62.9,63.5],"en":"Give me the bag."},{"t":[63.6,65.2],"en":"No, look, I don't know what else to do."},{"t":[65.2,66.3],"en":"I said I'm sorry."},{"t":[66.4,66.7],"en":"Joey."},{"t":[66.8,68],"en":"Now, you should scream at me"},{"t":[68,69.4],"en":"or curse me or hit me."},{"t":[70,71.1],"en":"I'm not gonna hit you."},{"t":[71.1,71.6],"en":"Why not?"},{"t":[71.8,72.4],"en":"You'll feel better."},{"t":[72.4,73.1],"en":"I'll feel better."},{"t":[73.2,74],"en":"And you know you want to."},{"t":[74.1,75.3],"en":"I can see it in your eyes."},{"t":[77.1,77.9],"en":"No, I don't."},{"t":[78,78.6],"en":"A little bit."},{"t":[78.7,78.9],"en":"No."},{"t":[79.2,79.8],"en":"A little bit."},{"t":[81.5,81.9],"en":"No."},{"t":[82,82.8],"en":"A little bit more."},{"t":[83.9,84.8],"en":"No, hit me."},{"t":[84.9,85.6],"en":"Give me the bag."},{"t":[85.6,85.9],"en":"Hit me."},{"t":[86.3,87.3],"en":"Joey, give me the bag."},{"t":[87.4,87.6],"en":"Hit me."},{"t":[87.7,88.5],"en":"Joe, I'm not kidding."},{"t":[88.5,88.8],"en":"Hit me."},{"t":[88.9,90.5],"en":"No, hit me, hit me, hit me, hit me."},{"t":[103.5,104.7],"en":"You ducked."},{"t":[104.7,105.4],"en":"I'm sorry."},{"t":[105.5,106.4],"en":"It was a reflex."},{"t":[106.8,107.9],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[108,109.4],"en":"This really hurts."},{"t":[109.5,110.3],"en":"I couldn't help it."},{"t":[110.4,111.8],"en":"When a fist comes at your face,"},{"t":[111.8,112.4],"en":"you ducked."},{"t":[112.5,112.7],"en":"Look."},{"t":[112.9,113.7],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[115.7,118.1],"en":"What is the matter with you?"},{"t":[118.8,120.3],"en":"You were supposed to duck."},{"t":[120.4,121.1],"en":"Why didn't you duck?"},{"t":[121.2,122.2],"en":"Why don't we talk about this"},{"t":[122.2,123.3],"en":"on the way to the hospital?"},{"t":[123.4,124],"en":"Good, good."},{"t":[124.1,125.1],"en":"Yeah, maybe while we're there,"},{"t":[125.2,126.6],"en":"they can check your reflexes."},{"t":[128.1,129.1],"en":"I broke my thumb."},{"t":[129.1,129.3],"en":"I broke my thumb."},{"t":[129.8,130.4],"en":"Your thumb?"},{"t":[134.6,135.3],"en":"That's weird."},{"t":[136.4,137.7],"en":"Are you sure you're punching right?"},{"t":[137.8,138.5],"en":"Make a fist."},{"t":[140.8,141.5],"en":"Maybe later."},{"t":[143.1,144.2],"en":"Ross, I feel terrible."},{"t":[145,145.4],"en":"You know what?"},{"t":[145.4,146],"en":"You can go."},{"t":[146,148],"en":"I just have to fill out some forms."},{"t":[153.9,155.8],"en":"You, uh, you want me to help you with that?"},{"t":[156,156.2],"en":"Why?"},{"t":[156.2,157.4],"en":"Does it look like I'm having trouble"},{"t":[157.4,158.7],"en":"with my misshapen claw?"},{"t":[163.4,163.9],"en":"Name."},{"t":[166.7,168],"en":"No, I know Ross,"},{"t":[168.1,169.4],"en":"but what's it short for?"},{"t":[169.9,171.2],"en":"You know, like, like 